SUMMARY:⚡ VIX Expiration
DESCRIPTION:VIX Expiration\nWednesday 19 August 2026\n\nTime\n9:30 AM ET 
  |  13:30 UTC\n\nNotes\nVIX futures and options settle on the opening SO
 Q. Falls on the Wednesday 30 days before the following month's third Fri
 day. Volatility positions unwind into this and the settlement print can 
 sit far from where VIX last traded.
